msgid "Executable memory: games run at full speed, no HEN grant needed"
msgstr "Bộ nhớ thực thi: trò chơi chạy đủ tốc độ, không cần HEN cấp quyền"

#: port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:154
msgid "Cemu's and Azahar's recompilers turn the games' code into the PS5's as they run. They need memory they can write code into and run it from: your HEN's JIT memory, or executable memory PS5-ECAM makes itself."
